---
globs: config/**/*.yml,config/**/*.yaml,configs/**/*.yml,configs/**/*.yaml,settings/**/*.yml,settings/**/*.yaml,*.{yml},*.{yaml}
alwaysApply: false
---
# YAML config

- Preserve structure and semantics; make minimal edits only where required.
- Keep indentation and quoting consistent with the file’s existing style.
- Do not introduce YAML anchors/aliases unless the repo already uses them.
- Avoid broad rewrites/reordering; touch only relevant keys/sections.
- If changing behavior/config values, include a brief Verify checklist (outside the file) when responding.
